ng radio station in Korea, ARIRANG RADIO.\nWe broadcast a variety of Korean culture including K-Pop music as well as news and useful information 24 hours a day.\n\n✅ Arirang TV 11AM-12PM KST\n✅ Arirang Radio App\n\n#culturecrunch #arirangradio #ChiHee #디아 #DIA","published_at":"2026-09-17","group_ko":"디아#a1897","members":["디아"],"with_groups":[],"with_members":[],"cover_of_groups":[],"cover_of_members":[],"source_handle":"arirangradio","tags_manual":true,"content_flag":null},"after":{"id":"h5E-qf13XCk","title":"DIA(디아) - Neverland  | K-Pop Live Session | Culture Crunch","description":"DIA(디아) paid a visit to Arirang Radio!\nCheck out the live performances of their amazing song 'Neverland’ only on this video.\n\nVisit to Arirang Radio's Home Page to meet more K-Pop Stars!\nhttp://www.arirangradio.com\n\n▶Subscribe Arirang Radio: https://www.youtube.com/Music180Arirang\n——————————————————————————————\nThe first English broadcasting radio station in Korea, ARIRANG RADIO.\nWe broadcast a variety of Korean culture including K-Pop music as well as news and useful information 24 hours a day.\n\n✅ Arirang TV 11AM-12PM KST\n✅ Arirang Radio App\n\n#culturecrunch #arirangradio #ChiHee #디아 #DIA","published_at":"2026-09-17","group_ko":"다이아","members":[],"with_groups":[],"with_members":[],"cover_of_groups":[],"cover_of_members":[],"source_handle":"arirangradio","tags_manual":false,"content_flag":null}},{"before":{"id":"O-Fpg_FQv3A","title":"Tune-in Time with Ballad Singer DIA 디아","description":"🎤Tune-in Time🎤\n\nEnjoy live performances of various genres every Wednesday 🔊\n\nSinger DIA, whose delicate and soulful voice beautifully captures the emotions of a heartfelt ballad! 🎼 From her lyrical and soothing music to her unique charm as a vocalist, we’ll hear the stories behind DIA’s music and discover the emotions she brings to every song. Recently drawing attention with her unique “Lie-down Live” performances, DIA shows that music can be intimate, emotional, and beautifully unexpected. Experience her tender and captivating voice through two special live performances of her own songs! 🎶 Check it out now on YouTube! 🎧📺\n\n수요일마다 이어지는 여러 장르의 라이브 공연을 즐기러 오세요 🔊\n\n서정적이고 감미로운 음색으로 발라드의 애절한 감성을 고스란히 전하는 가수 디아(DIA) 님! 🎼 디아 님의 음악에 담긴 이야기부터 한 소절 한 소절 깊은 감정을 전하는 그녀만의 음악 이야기까지 만나봅니다. 최근에는 누워서 노래하는 이색적인 ‘눕라이브’로 많은 주목을 받으며 색다른 매력까지 보여주고 있는데요! 디아 님의 감미롭고도 애절한 목소리로 만나보는 두 곡의 특별한 라이브를 통해 그녀만의 음악적 매력에 빠져보세요! 🎶 지금 바로 유튜브에서 만나보세요! 🎧📺\n\n✅ Arirang TV 11AM-12PM KST\n✅ Arirang Radio App\n\n▶Subscribe Arirang Radio: https://www.youtube.com/Music180Arirang\n——————————————————————————————\nThe first English broadcasting radio station in Korea, ARIRANG RADIO.\nWe broadcast a variety of Korean culture including K-Pop music as well as news and useful information 24 hours a day.\n\n#culturecrunch #arirangradio #ChiHee #디아 #DIA","published_at":"2026-09-17","group_ko":"디아#a1897","members":["디아"],"with_groups":[],"with_members":[],"cover_of_groups":[],"cover_of_members":[],"source_handle":"arirangradio","tags_manual":true,"content_flag":null},"after":{"id":"O-Fpg_FQv3A","title":"Tune-in Time with Ballad Singer DIA 디아","description":"🎤Tune-in Time🎤\n\nEnjoy live performances of various genres every Wednesday 🔊\n\nSinger DIA, whose delicate and soulful voice beautifully captures the emotions of a heartfelt ballad! 🎼 From her lyrical and soothing music to her unique charm as a vocalist, we’ll hear the stories behind DIA’s music and discover the emotions she brings to every song. Recently drawing attention with her unique “Lie-down Live” performances, DIA shows that music can be intimate, emotional, and beautifully unexpected. Experience her tender and captivating voice through two special live performances of her own songs! 🎶 Check it out now on YouTube! 🎧📺\n\n수요일마다 이어지는 여러 장르의 라이브 공연을 즐기러 오세요 🔊\n\n서정적이고 감미로운 음색으로 발라드의 애절한 감성을 고스란히 전하는 가수 디아(DIA) 님! 🎼 디아 님의 음악에 담긴 이야기부터 한 소절 한 소절 깊은 감정을 전하는 그녀만의 음악 이야기까지 만나봅니다. 최근에는 누워서 노래하는 이색적인 ‘눕라이브’로 많은 주목을 받으며 색다른 매력까지 보여주고 있는데요! 디아 님의 감미롭고도